    "description": "Wicca Collectors Collage\nNatural Curio Shadow Box Display\nWood, Bone, and Stone Assemblage, 16.5 x 12.25 Inches\nThis assemblage, titled \"Wicca Collectors Collage,\" is a curated collection of natural and archeological-style specimens mounted in a professional shadow box display. The collection features a variety of earth-toned textures, including fossilized shark teeth, lithic fragments, and weathered organic elements. Such assemblages are highly sought after by collectors of natural history, curiosity cabinets, and those seeking focal pieces for spiritual or decorative spaces.\nContains approximately 22 individual specimens including fossilized shark teeth, pottery sherds, and stone fragments\nProfessional black frame construction with glass front and white textured fiber background\nFeatures a mix of natural materials including weathered wood, bone-like elements, and mineral specimens\nOverall dimensions: 16.5 inches H x 12.25 inches L x 1.25 inches W\nCondition:\nThe frame is structurally sound with minor shelf wear and light surface scuffing visible on the black finish. The glass front is clear and free of cracks or significant scratches. All internal specimens appear securely mounted to the background with no shifting or loose pieces visible. The interior display remains clean and free of dust accumulation.",
